"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p028","quote":"陳皇后母大長公主，景帝姊也，數讓武帝姊平陽公主曰：「帝非我不得立，已而棄捐吾女，壹何不自喜而倍本乎！」平陽公主曰：「用無子故廢耳。」陳皇后求子，與醫錢凡九千萬，然竟無子。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"武帝姊平陽公主","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"按明示子女、生、母、兄弟姊及婚姻的局部敘事保存；祖孫不作父子，不補未名者姓名。衛青子數各層原語並存，親屬判讀不代表數量已核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"a-shiji049-046","subject_person_id":"5dd_l1c_6g8","predicate":"spouse","object_person_id":"nad_18h_5jc","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi","source_id":"s-shiji-049-waiqi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p037","quote":"是時平陽主寡居，當用列侯尚主。主與左右議長安中列侯可為夫者，皆言大將軍可。主笑曰：「此出吾家，常使令騎從我出入耳，柰何用為夫乎？」左右侍御者曰：「今大將軍姊為皇后，三子為侯，富貴振動天下，主何以易之乎？」於是主乃許之。言之皇后，令白之武帝，乃詔衛將軍尚平陽公主焉。"}],"qualifiers":{"source_term":"衛將軍尚平陽公主","historicity":"historical_tradition"},"interpretation_note":"按明示子女、生、母、兄弟姊及婚姻的局部敘事保存；祖孫不作父子，不補未名者姓名。衛青子數各層原語並存，親屬判讀不代表數量已核定。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m024-0038","start":38,"end":42,"surface":"平陽公主","kind":"person","person_id":"nad_18h_5jc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p024","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0028","start":28,"end":31,"surface":"平陽主","kind":"person","person_id":"nad_18h_5jc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p026","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0045","start":45,"end":48,"surface":"平陽主","kind":"person","person_id":"nad_18h_5jc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p026","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:m026-0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"平陽主","kind":"person","person_id":"nad_18h_5jc","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi:p026","chapter_id":"c-shiji-049-waiqi"},{"id":"c-shiji